      "reviewed_at": "2026-10-02T02:33:28.737622+00:00",
      "authority": "Make it in Germany",
      "reliability_tier": 2,
      "evidence_summary": "The official Make it in Germany portal lists 140 full or 280 half working days annually for third-country students, with four hours defining a half day. It also describes a 20-hour weekly lecture-period alternative and unrestricted semester breaks. Academic auxiliary tasks are treated separately; self-employment requires local foreigners-authority approval.",
      "evidence_method": "official_page_reviewed_summary"
    },
